# Refuse any version published less than 7 days ago (needs npm 11.10+; packageManager pins 11.16.0).
# It acts only when npm resolves a version (npm install <pkg>, npm update);
# `npm ci` of the current lock is unaffected.
# A security fix that needs a younger version overrides it for that one bump, after the
# pre-merge review: npm install <pkg>@<version> --min-release-age=0
min-release-age=7
